    "item_body": "<p>Connected by SSH to a remote server, a student runs a program that creates results.txt. They then close the connection and look in the file manager on their laptop. Where is results.txt?</p>",
    "interaction_type_slug": "choice",
    "interaction_data": {
      "choices": [
        {"position": 1, "item_body": "<p>On the laptop, because that is the computer the student is using</p>"},
        {"position": 2, "item_body": "<p>On the server, because that is where the program ran; it is not on the laptop</p>"},
        {"position": 3, "item_body": "<p>On both, because SSH keeps the two machines' files in sync</p>"},
        {"position": 4, "item_body": "<p>Nowhere; files made over SSH are temporary and vanish when the connection closes</p>"}
      ]
    },
